---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import HeroCarousel from "../components/HeroCarousel.astro";
import {
  taizanLogo,
  indexCarousel,
  thumbnailImages,
  hachiojiStationImage,
} from "../components/blocks/images";
---

<Base
  description="東京八王子本部道場。合気柔術・柔道・空手を融合した実践的な護身術・逮捕術と、武道の知識を活かした指圧整体。初心者・体験稽古歓迎。"
>

  <div id="home">
    <HeroCarousel images={indexCarousel} alt="八王子本部道場での稽古風景">
      <h1 class="hero-title">
        <span class="line-1">
          <span class="ja">泰山流護身術・逮捕術</span>
          <span class="en">Peaceful Mountain System</span>
        </span><br>
        <span class="line-2">
          <span class="ja">-東京八王子本部道場-</span>
          <span class="en">-Tokyo Hachioji Head Quarter Dojo-</span>
        </span>
      </h1>
      <h2 class="hero-subtitle">Taizan-ryu Martial Arts</h2>
      <p class="hero-author">
        <span class="ja">守破離の精神で、真の護身を。</span>
        <span class="en">True self-defense through Shu-Ha-Ri.</span>
      </p>
    </HeroCarousel>
  </div>

  <div class="container">

<section class="features-section" id="features">
      <div class="feature-grid">
        
        <a href="/self-defense" class="feature-card reveal">
          <div class="feature-image-wrapper">
            <img src={thumbnailImages[0]} alt="柔術稽古" />
          </div>
          <div class="feature-text">
            <h2><span class="ja">泰山流護身術・逮捕術</span><span class="en">Taizan-ryu Martial Arts</span></h2>
            <p class="ja">60年以上の武道経験に基づく実践的な護身術。合気柔術、柔道、空手の技術を統合し、現代社会に適応した効果的な防御システムを学びます。</p>
            <p class="en">A practical self-defense system grounded in over 60 years of martial arts experience. Integrating Aiki-Jujutsu, Judo, and Karate to master an effective defense system adapted to modern life.</p>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a href="/shiatsu" class="feature-card reveal">
          <div class="feature-image-wrapper">
            <img src={thumbnailImages[1]} alt="指圧治療院" />
          </div>
          <div class="feature-text">
            <h2><span class="ja">泰山流指圧整体院</span><span class="en">Taizan-ryu Shiatsu Clinic</span></h2>
            <p class="ja">武道の知識と経験を活かした独自の整体・指圧療法。身体のバランスを整え、自然治癒力を高めることで、心身の健康をサポートします。</p>
            <p class="en">A unique shiatsu therapy drawing on martial arts knowledge and experience. We restore body balance and enhance your natural healing power to support holistic health.</p>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a href="/soke" class="feature-card reveal">
          <div class="feature-image-wrapper">
            <img src={thumbnailImages[2]} alt="宗家ジョー・ミラー" />
          </div>
          <div class="feature-text">
            <h2><span class="ja">宗家について</span><span class="en">About the Soke</span></h2>
            <p class="ja">伝統的な術から独立し、泰山流を創始。実戦的な護身術「逮捕術」と、心身を癒す「泰山流指圧」の両面から、バランスの取れた武道を指導しています。</p>
            <p class="en">Departing from traditional systems to found Taizan-ryu. Teaching a balanced martial way through both the practical self-defense of Taiho Jutsu and the healing art of Taizan-ryu Shiatsu.</p>
          </div>
        </a>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- <section class="news surface-white" id="news">
      <div class="news-inner">
        <div class="news-header">
          <p class="news-eyebrow">Taizan-ryu</p>
          <h2><span class="ja">お知らせ</span><span class="en">Latest News</span></h2>
          <div class="news-divider"></div>
        </div>

        {newsItems.length === 0 ? (
          <p class="news-empty"><span class="ja">準備中</span><span class="en">Coming Soon</span></p>
        ) : (
          <ul class="news-list">
            {newsItems.map((item) => (
              <li class="news-item">
                <span class="news-date">{item.data.date}</span>
                {item.data.category && (
                  <span class="news-category">{item.data.category}</span>
                )}
                <span class="news-title">{item.data.title}</span>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        )}
      </div>
    </section> -->

    <section class="emblem surface-light" id="emblem">
      <div class="banner-image">
        <img
                src={ taizanLogo }
                alt="泰山流のロゴ"
        />
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="featured-works" id="works">
      <dl>
        <dt class="reveal">
          <span class="work-num">1</span>
          <img
                src={ thumbnailImages[3] }
                alt="国境を越えて集う仲間たち"
          />
        </dt>
        <dd class="reveal">
          <h3><span class="ja">国境を越えて集う仲間たち</span><span class="en">Students from Around the World</span></h3>
          <span class="ja">世界中から集まった生徒たちが、泰山流の技術と精神を学び、共に成長しています。国籍や背景を超えた絆が、道場を一層豊かなものにしています。</span>
          <span class="en">Students from across the globe come to learn the art and spirit of Taizan-ryu and grow together. Bonds that transcend nationality and background make our dojo all the richer.</span>
          <a href="/event-photos" class="btn"><span class="ja">ページへ行く</span><span class="en">Visit Page</span></a>
        </dd>
        <dt class="reveal">
          <span class="work-num">2</span>
          <img
                src={ thumbnailImages[4] }
                alt="稽古仲間たち"
          />
        </dt>
        <dd class="reveal">
          <h3><span class="ja">泰山流の技術</span><span class="en">Taizan-ryu Techniques</span></h3>
          <span class="ja">宗家ジョー・ミラーによる技術解説と、道場での稽古の様子をご覧ください。基本技術から実戦応用まで、映像を通じて泰山流の技術と哲学を体験できます。</span>
          <span class="en">Watch technique explanations by Soke Joe Miller and training sessions at the dojo. Experience the art and philosophy of Taizan-ryu through video, from fundamentals to practical application.</span>
          <a href="/self-defense#videos" class="btn"><span class="ja">ページへ行く</span><span class="en">Visit Page</span></a>
        </dd>
        <dt class="reveal">
          <span class="work-num">3</span>
          <img
                src={ thumbnailImages[5] }
                alt="泰山流のロゴ"
          />
        </dt>
        <dd class="reveal">
          <h3><span class="ja">治療院お客様の声</span><span class="en">Client Testimonials</span></h3>
          <span class="ja">泰山流指圧整体院での施術を受けたお客様からの感想と体験談をご紹介します。身体の不調が改善された喜びの声が多数寄せられています。</span>
          <span class="en">Testimonials and stories from clients who have received treatment at Taizan-ryu Shiatsu Clinic. Many have shared the joy of finding relief from chronic conditions.</span>
          <a href="/testimonials" class="btn"><span class="ja">ページへ行く</span><span class="en">Visit Page</span></a>
        </dd>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <section class="access surface-light" id="access">
      <h3><span class="ja">アクセス</span><span class="en">Location</span></h3>
      <div class="access-hero">
        <img
          src={ hachiojiStationImage }
          alt="八王子駅"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="access-info">
        <p>1-29-1 Koyasu-cho, Hachioji-shi, Tokyo 192-0904</p>
        <p><span class="ja">八王子駅南口より徒歩5分</span><span class="en">5 min walk from Hachioji Station South Exit</span></p>
        <p><span class="ja">新宿駅から30分、日本全国からアクセス良好</span><span class="en">30 min from Shinjuku, easily accessible from anywhere in Japan</span></p>
      </div>
      <iframe
        id="map-iframe"
        title="Google Maps — 泰山流道場"
        data-src-ja="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3242.0163513502466!2d139.3370407760321!3d35.65196877259671!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x60191ddb5bd357c9%3A0xe6ea1e69ca00b8b!2z44CSMTkyLTA5MDQg5p2x5Lqs6YO95YWr546L5a2Q5biC5a2Q5a6J55S677yR5LiB55uu77yS77yZ4oiS77yR!5e0!3m2!1sja!2sjp!4v1778164204991!5m2!1sja!2sjp"
        data-src-en="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3242.0163513502466!2d139.3370407760321!3d35.65196877259671!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x60191ddb5bd357c9%3A0xe6ea1e69ca00b8b!2z44CSMTkyLTA5MDQg5p2x5Lqs6YO95YWr546L5a2Q5biC5a2Q5a6J55S677yR5LiB55uu77yS77yZ4oiS77yR!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjp!4v1778164204991!5m2!1sen!2sjp"
        src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3242.0163513502466!2d139.3370407760321!3d35.65196877259671!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x60191ddb5bd357c9%3A0xe6ea1e69ca00b8b!2z44CSMTkyLTA5MDQg5p2x5Lqs6YO95YWr546L5a2Q5biC5a2Q5a6J55S677yR5LiB55uu77yS77yZ4oiS77yR!5e0!3m2!1sja!2sjp!4v1778164204991!5m2!1sja!2sjp"
      ></iframe>
    </section>

  </div>
</Base>

<script>
  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
    // Google Maps 言語切り替え
    const mapIframe = document.getElementById('map-iframe') as HTMLIFrameElement | null;
    if (mapIframe) {
      function updateMapLang(lang: string) {
        const src = lang === 'en'
          ? mapIframe!.dataset.srcEn
          : mapIframe!.dataset.srcJa;
        if (src && mapIframe!.src !== src) mapIframe!.src = src;
      }

      // 初期言語を反映
      updateMapLang(document.documentElement.dataset.lang || 'ja');

      // 言語変更を監視
      new MutationObserver(() => {
        updateMapLang(document.documentElement.dataset.lang || 'ja');
      }).observe(document.documentElement, { attributeFilter: ['data-lang'] });
    }
  });
</script>

<style>
  /* --- 統合セクション (カードレイアウト) --- */
  .feature-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); /* 3列のグリッド */
    gap: 40px;
  }

  /* カード全体のスタイル */
  .feature-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  /* 画像のラッパー（背景白、サイズ統一、ホバーエフェクト） */
  .feature-image-wrapper {
    background-color: #ffffff; /* 背景を白に */
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; /* すべての画像を 4:3 の比率で統一 */
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1), box-shadow 0.4s ease;
  }

  /* 画像自体の設定 */
  .feature-image-wrapper img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover; /* 枠に合わせてトリミング。余白を残したい場合は 'contain' に変更 */
    transition: transform 0.4s ease;
  }

  /* ホバー時のエフェクト（ふわっと浮き上がり、影がつく） */
  .feature-card:hover .feature-image-wrapper {
    transform: translateY(-10px);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
  }

  /* テキスト部分のスタイル */
  .feature-text {
    padding: 25px 10px 10px 10px;
  }

  .feature-text h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .feature-text p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* ホバー時にタイトル文字色を少し変える（任意） */
  .feature-card:hover .feature-text h2 {
    color: #e0d5ce;
  }

  /* スマホ・タブレット用レスポンシブ対応 */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .feature-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr; /* スマホでは縦1列に */
      gap: 50px;
    }
  }

  /* --- container は hero の直後に来るため padding-top 不要 --- */
  .container {
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .hero-title, .hero-subtitle, .hero-author {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(30px);
    animation: floatUp 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1) forwards;
  }
  .hero-title { animation-delay: 0.2s; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .hero-subtitle { animation-delay: 0.6s; font-size: 1.2rem; letter-spacing: 3px; }
  .hero-author { animation-delay: 1.0s; font-size: 1rem; margin-top: 40px; letter-spacing: 2px; }

  .line-1 { font-size: 3.5rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 4px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .line-2 { font-size: 3rem; letter-spacing: 2px; font-weight: 300; }

  @keyframes floatUp { to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }

  /* --- スマホ・タブレット用レスポンシブ対応 --- */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .container { padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px; }
    .self-defense, .shiatsu, .background-exhibits { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }

    .featured-works dt { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 15px; }
    .featured-works img { width: 100%; height: auto; }
    .featured-works dd { margin-left: 0; }

    .line-1 { font-size: 2rem; }
    .line-2 { font-size: 1.1rem; }
    .hero-subtitle { font-size: 1rem; }

    .features-section,
    .featured-works {
      padding: 40px 0;
    }

    .schedule,
    .news,
    .access {
      padding: 40px 20px;
    }
  }

  /* --- Featured Works (横並び & ボタン) --- */
  .featured-works dl {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; /* dtを左、ddを右の残りのスペースに配置 */
    align-items: center; /* 縦方向の中央揃え */
    column-gap: 50px; /* 左右の余白 */
    row-gap: 60px;    /* 上下の余白 */
  }

  .featured-works dt {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 25px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .featured-works .work-num {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .featured-works img {
    width: 300px;
    height: 150px;
    object-fit: contain;
    background-color: #0d0806;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .featured-works dd {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 15px; /* 見出し、テキスト、ボタン間の余白 */
  }

  .featured-works h3 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* --- 空色のリンクボタン --- */
  .featured-works .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: #38bdf8; /* 鮮やかな空色 */
    color: #0f172a; /* 視認性を高めるための濃い文字色 */
    padding: 10px 28px;
    border-radius: 30px; /* 角丸 */
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }

  .featured-works .btn:hover {
    background-color: #7dd3fc; /* ホバー時は少し明るい空色に */
    transform: translateY(-3px); /* ふわっと浮く */
    box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3); /* 空色の影 */
  }

  /* --- スマホ用レスポンシブ対応 --- */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .featured-works dl {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr; /* スマホでは縦1列に戻す */
      row-gap: 30px;
    }
    .featured-works dt {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .featured-works dd {
      padding-bottom: 40px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); /* 見やすくするための区切り線 */
    }
    .featured-works dd:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }
    .featured-works img {
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
    }
  }

  /* --- エンブレムセクション (全画面幅 & 位置調整) --- */
  .emblem {
    position: relative;
    width: 100vw;
    height: 300px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .emblem img {
    width: 200px;
    height: 200px;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  /* --- アクセスセクション (全画面幅) --- */
  .access {
    position: relative;
    width: 100vw;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    text-align: center;
    padding: 80px 20px;
  }

  .access h3 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }

  .access-info {
    padding: 0 20px; /* スマホなどで文字が端にくっつかないようにする */
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .access-hero img {
    width: calc(100% + 40px); /* padding 20px 両側分を加算して section 端まで伸ばす */
    margin-left: -20px;       /* left padding 分だけ左にずらして左端を揃える */
    height: 350px;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  /* Googleマップを全画面幅に */
  .access iframe {
    width: 100%; /* HTML側の width="600" を上書きして全幅にする */
    height: 450px;
    display: block;
  }

  .features-section {
    padding: 80px 0;
  }

  .news {
    position: relative;
    width: 100vw;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    padding: 80px 20px;
    margin: 60px 0;
  }

  .news-inner {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .news-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .news-eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #999;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .news h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: 8px;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .news-divider {
    width: 32px;
    height: 1px;
    background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .news-list {
    list-style: none;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  }

  .news-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 18px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .news-item:hover {
    background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02);
    padding-left: 8px;
  }

  .news-date {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    color: #888;
    white-space: nowrap;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .news-category {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #fff;
    background-color: #6B1F23;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .news-title {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .news-empty {
    text-align: center;
    color: #999;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }

  .featured-works {
    padding: 80px 0;
  }
</style>